sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as 前端 HostDetailView
    participant API as FastAPI Router
    participant AS as AnalysisService
    participant SRA as ServiceRiskAnalyzer
    participant RA as RiskAssessor
    participant RD as raw_data (JSON)

    Note over FE,RD: ── 触发分析流程 ──
    FE->>API: POST /hosts/{id}/analyze
    API->>AS: analyze(host_id)
    AS->>RD: ImportService.read_raw_json(host_id)

    Note over AS: 步骤 1: clear_analysis_by_host()
    Note over AS: 步骤 2: RuleEngine.load_rules()
    Note over AS: 步骤 3: ProfileBuilder.build() → HostProfile
    Note over AS: 步骤 4: AnomalyDetector (进程/外连/启动项)

    AS->>AS: 步骤 5: PersistenceFinder.find_all()<br/>+ assess_suspicious()

    Note over AS: ═══ 步骤 5.5: 新增服务风险检测 ═══
    AS->>SRA: ServiceRiskAnalyzer.analyze(raw_data, host_id)

    activate SRA
    SRA->>SRA: _extract_services(raw_data)
    Note over SRA: 从 raw_data.persistence.services<br/>提取服务列表 (200-500条)

    SRA->>SRA: _detect_tamper(services)
    Note over SRA: 遍历服务 × SECURITY_SERVICES白名单<br/>检查 status≠running 或 start_type异常<br/>→ DetectionResult(P0-1-TAMPER)

    SRA->>SRA: _detect_shadow(services)
    Note over SRA: 编辑距离名称伪装检测<br/>路径异常检测 (Temp/AppData)<br/>幽灵服务检测<br/>→ DetectionResult(P0-2-SHADOW)

    SRA->>SRA: _detect_priv_esc(services)
    Note over SRA: 检查 LocalSystem + 可疑路径<br/>→ DetectionResult(P1-PRIVESC)

    SRA->>SRA: _calculate_aggregate_score(services)
    Note over SRA: SUM(weight × triggered) / max<br/>归一化 → 0-100

    SRA-->>AS: ServiceRiskReport
    deactivate SRA

    AS->>AS: findings["service_risks"] = report

    Note over AS: 步骤 6: IocChecker.check()
    Note over AS: 步骤 7: TimelineBuilder.build()
    Note over AS: 步骤 8: 数据采集增强 (网络/哈希/WMI/注册表)
    Note over AS: 步骤 8.6: 文件哈希情报匹配
    Note over AS: 步骤 8.5: 攻击链关联检测

    AS->>RA: RiskAssessor.assess(findings)

    activate RA
    RA->>RA: 计算 service_risks 维度
    Note over RA: svc_score = aggregate_score × 0.15<br/>合并到总风险分
    RA-->>AS: risk_result
    deactivate RA

    Note over AS: 步骤 10: AnalysisResult.create_or_replace()
    AS-->>API: result dict
    API-->>FE: { code:0, data: result }

    Note over FE,RD: ── 查询服务风险 (独立调用) ──
    FE->>API: GET /hosts/{id}/service-risk
    API->>AS: get_service_risk(host_id)
    AS->>RD: ImportService.read_raw_json(host_id)
    AS->>SRA: ServiceRiskAnalyzer.analyze(raw_data, host_id)

    activate SRA
    Note over SRA: 实时执行全部4个检测规则<br/>纯内存计算 (<100ms for 500 services)
    SRA-->>AS: ServiceRiskReport
    deactivate SRA

    AS-->>API: report dict
    API-->>FE: { code:0, data: report }
    Note over FE: ServicesTable 渲染<br/>风险评分列 + 检测标签 + 行展开详情
